    title: "swift: only 16.5% of external method-call edges carry a receiver type (505/3,067 on vapor) -- inferred and chained receivers never reach the module slot, and 93 of 107 swift rows are method-kind with no second disjunct"  # 73cd
    status: todo_hard  # 73cd
    priority: 2  # 73cd
    parent:  # 73cd
    tags:  # 73cd
    - taint  # 73cd
